msgstr "Navn kundene ser"

#. translators: Radio button label on a print size: this size is chosen when the designer opens. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:63
msgid "Starts selected"
msgstr "Valgt fra start"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:71
msgid "Choose a template for this side."
msgstr "Velg en mal for denne siden."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:72
msgid "Choose where on the blank this side is printed."
msgstr "Velg hvor på basisproduktet denne siden skal trykkes."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:73
msgid "Enter the width and height in millimetres."
msgstr "Skriv inn bredde og høyde i millimeter."

#. translators: Shown under a custom print size's width and height. %1$s: the largest width, %2$s: the largest height the side's placement prints, both in millimetres. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "Up to %1$s × %2$s mm"
msgstr "Opptil %1$s × %2$s mm"

#. translators: Error under a custom print size larger than the placement prints. %1$s: the largest width, %2$s: the largest height, both in millimetres. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:75
#, php-format
msgid "This placement prints at most %1$s × %2$s mm."
msgstr "Denne plasseringen kan trykke høyst %1$s × %2$s mm."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:79
msgctxt "product side such as front or back"
msgid "Side"
msgstr "Side"

#. translators: Button that removes a whole side from the product. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:82
msgid "Remove side"
msgstr "Fjern side"

#. translators: Label of the fields naming a product side and its key. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:85
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Navn"

#. translators: Placeholder of the field naming a product side, which customers see. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:87
msgid "Name customers see, e.g. Front"
msgstr "Navn kundene ser, f.eks. Forside"

#. translators: Placeholder of the field for a side's key, a short lowercase identifier. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:88
msgid "Key, e.g. front"
msgstr "Nøkkel, f.eks. front"

#. translators: Screen reader label of the field for a side's key. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:88
msgid "Side key"
msgstr "Sidenøkkel"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:90
msgid ""
"The name customers see on the side’s tab, and the key the cart and order "
"keep it under. Empty, both follow the placement."
msgstr ""
"Navnet kundene ser på fanen til siden, og nøkkelen handlekurven og ordren "
"lagrer den under. Står feltene tomme, følger begge plasseringen."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown that picks the blank's placement (print area) a side is printed on. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:93
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "Plassering"

#. translators: First option of the placement dropdown, nothing chosen yet. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:96
msgid "Choose a placement"
msgstr "Velg en plassering"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:106
msgid "Where on the blank this side is printed."
msgstr "Hvor på basisproduktet denne siden trykkes."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:109
msgctxt "Pixonaut template that customers fill in"
msgid "Template"
msgstr "Mal"

#. translators: Placeholder of the template search dropdown. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:111
msgid "Search for a template"
msgstr "Søk etter en mal"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:119
msgid ""
"What customers fill in. With a blank, only templates that fit the placement "
"are listed."
msgstr ""
"Det kundene fyller ut. Med et basisprodukt vises bare maler som passer til "
"plasseringen."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:122
msgid ""
"This template’s background shows through, and this product has no blank: "
"customers see the design on white paper in the designer, and it prints on "
"white paper. You probably want to set a background on the template in "
"Pixonaut. If transparent is what you intend, leave it as it is; customers "
"can still buy the product."
msgstr ""
"Bakgrunnen i malen er gjennomsiktig, og produktet har ikke noe basisprodukt: "
"Kundene ser designet på hvitt papir i designverktøyet, og det trykkes på "
"hvitt papir. Du vil sannsynligvis angi en bakgrunn på malen i Pixonaut. Hvis "
"gjennomsiktig er meningen, lar du det være som det er; kundene kan fortsatt "
"kjøpe produktet."

#. translators: Label of the setting that keeps a product side on one version of its template. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:125
msgid "Template version"
msgstr "Malversjon"

#. translators: Checkbox on a product side: keep the side on the template version picked beside it instead of moving to each new version published. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:129
msgid "Stick to one version"
msgstr "Lås til én versjon"

#. translators: Option of a product side's template version picker: the template's latest published version. %d: its number, e.g. 3. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:132 templates/admin/product-side.php:143
#, php-format
msgid "Version %d (current)"
msgstr "Versjon %d (gjeldende)"

#. translators: Option of a product side's template version picker. %d: the version's number, e.g. 2. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:133 templates/admin/product-side.php:145
#, php-format
msgid "Version %d"
msgstr "Versjon %d"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:154
msgid ""
"The side moves to each new version of the template when it is published, "
"keeping its groups and print sizes. Stuck to one version, it stays on it "
"until you change it here."
msgstr ""
"Siden går over til hver nye versjon av malen når den publiseres, og beholder "
"gruppene og trykkstørrelsene sine. Låst til én versjon blir den på den til "
"du endrer det her."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:162
msgid "Personalised: customers fill in the template"
msgstr "Personalisert: kundene fyller ut malen"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:163
msgid "Standing: printed as the template is, with nothing to fill in"
msgstr "Fast: trykkes slik malen er, uten noe å fylle ut"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:165
msgid ""
"A standing side is printed from one design of the template, made when you "
"update the product. A product whose sides are all standing sells without the "
"designer."
msgstr ""
"En fast side trykkes fra ett design av malen, som lages når du oppdaterer "
"produktet. Et produkt der alle sidene er faste, selges uten designverktøyet."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:168
msgid ""
"This template offers fields to fill in. On a standing side customers do not "
"get to fill them in: it is printed as the template is."
msgstr ""
"Denne malen har felt som kan fylles ut. På en fast side får ikke kundene "
"fylle dem ut: den trykkes slik malen er."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:171
msgid ""
"This template offers nothing to fill in, so customers have nothing to "
"personalise. Make the side standing to sell it as the template is."
msgstr ""
"Denne malen har ingenting å fylle ut, så kundene har ingenting å "
"personalisere. Gjør siden fast for å selge den slik malen er."

#. translators: %s: the option a blank's print areas change with, as the blank names it, e.g. "Size". Label of a standing side's previews, one per value of that option. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:183
#, php-format
msgid "Per %s"
msgstr "Per %s"

#. translators: %s: the option a blank's print areas change with, as the blank names it, e.g. "Size". Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:189
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The print area changes with %s, so each of its values is printed from its "
"own design of this side, made when you update the product. Check how it sits "
"on each, and adjust its layout by hand where it needs it: an adjusted value "
"keeps its layout when the side changes, until you reset it."
msgstr ""
"Trykkområdet endres med %s, så hver verdi trykkes fra sitt eget design av "
"denne siden, som lages når du oppdaterer produktet. Sjekk hvordan det sitter "
"på hver av dem, og juster oppsettet for hånd der det trengs: En justert "
"verdi beholder oppsettet sitt når siden endres, til du tilbakestiller den."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:192
msgid ""
"The previews appear when you update the product. An adjusted value keeps its "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Forhåndsvisningene vises når du oppdaterer produktet. En justert verdi "
"beholder oppsettet sitt."

#. translators: 1: the option, e.g. "Size"; 2: its value, e.g. "XL". Alt text of a standing side's preview for one option. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:199
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s %2$s: the design on the blank"
msgstr "%1$s %2$s: designet på basisproduktet"

#. translators: Badge beside an option's value whose layout the store manager adjusted by hand on a standing side. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:208
msgid "Adjusted"
msgstr "Justert"

#. translators: Under a standing side's preview for one option value: the side's print size does not fit that value's print area, so the design prints at the value's usual size. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:215
msgid "Usual size: the side's is too big"
msgstr "Vanlig størrelse: sidens er for stor"

#. translators: Link that opens an option's adjusted layout on Pixonaut again, to adjust it once more. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:219
msgid "Adjust again"
msgstr "Juster igjen"

#. translators: %s: an option's value, e.g. "XL". Confirmation before the store manager resets the layout they adjusted by hand for that option. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:222
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Reset the layout of %s? It then follows the side again, and the layout you "
"adjusted is not kept."
msgstr ""
"Vil du tilbakestille oppsettet for %s? Verdien følger da siden igjen, og "
"oppsettet du justerte, beholdes ikke."

#. translators: Link that opens one option's design of a standing side on Pixonaut, to move and scale its artwork by hand. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:226
msgid "Adjust layout"
msgstr "Juster oppsett"

#. translators: %d: how many options a standing side has a preview of. Button that shows them all. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:235
#, php-format
msgid "Show all %d"
msgid_plural "Show all %d"
msgstr[0] "Vis alle %d"
msgstr[1] "Vis alle %d"

#. translators: Button that shows only the first of a standing side's option previews again. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:237
msgid "Show fewer"
msgstr "Vis færre"

#. translators: Label of the setting that arranges the designer's form groups for one product side; a button that shows or hides it. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:247
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Grupper"

#. translators: Label of the setting that arranges the designer's form groups for one product side; a button that shows or hides it. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:248
msgid ""
"The order and names of the groups customers see in the designer. Open to "
"arrange them."
msgstr ""
"Rekkefølgen og navnene på gruppene kundene ser i designverktøyet. Åpne "
"innstillingen for å ordne dem."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:251
msgid ""
"The order and names customers see in the designer on this product’s page. "
"Drag groups and their fields to reorder them. A name changed here is this "
"product’s only, and shows in every language; empty, the template’s own "
"shows. Once arranged here, this side no longer follows Options in the form."
msgstr ""
"Rekkefølgen og navnene kundene ser i designverktøyet på siden til dette "
"produktet. Dra grupper og feltene deres for å endre rekkefølgen. Et navn som "
"endres her, gjelder bare dette produktet og vises på alle språk; står det "
"tomt, vises malens eget. Når den er ordnet her, følger ikke denne siden "
"lenger Alternativer i skjemaet."

#. translators: Label of the list of print sizes customers choose from for a side. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:257
msgid "Print sizes"
msgstr "Trykkstørrelser"

#. translators: Button that adds a print size to a side. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:266
msgid "Add print size"
msgstr "Legg til trykkstørrelse"

#. translators: Button that adds a print size to a side. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:267
msgid ""
"Customers choose from these sizes. The one marked Starts selected is chosen "
"when the designer opens; with none marked, the first. Pixonaut checks each "
"one when you update the product; a size it cannot print is removed."
msgstr ""
"Kundene velger blant disse størrelsene. Den som er merket Valgt fra start, "
"er valgt når designverktøyet åpnes; er ingen merket, den første. Pixonaut "
"kontrollerer hver av dem når du oppdaterer produktet; en størrelse Pixonaut "
"ikke kan trykke, fjernes."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:268
msgid ""
"Without a blank, enter each size in millimetres, in the template’s aspect "
"ratio. A product without a print size cannot be bought."
msgstr ""
"Uten basisprodukt skriver du inn hver størrelse i millimeter, i malens "
"sideforhold. Et produkt uten trykkstørrelse kan ikke kjøpes."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:280
msgid ""
"The shape customers design this side on when a print size’s proportions are "
"not the template’s."
msgstr ""
"Formen på lerretet kundene designer denne siden på når proporsjonene til en "
"trykkstørrelse ikke er malens."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing which variant of the Pixonaut blank this product is printed on. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-variant.php:23
msgid "Blank variant"
msgstr "Basisproduktvariant"

#. translators: Checkbox label on a variable product's variation panel: this variation uses its own personalisation settings. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-variation.php:42
msgid "Override for this variation"
msgstr "Overstyr for denne varianten"

#: templates/admin/product-variation.php:45
msgid ""
"This variation is personalised as the product’s Pixonaut tab says. Tick to "
"give it its own blank, sides, templates and settings."
msgstr ""
"Denne varianten personaliseres slik produktets Pixonaut-fane angir. Kryss av "
"for å gi den eget basisprodukt og egne sider, maler og innstillinger."

#: templates/admin/product-variation.php:46
msgid ""
"This variation uses its own configuration below, not the product’s Pixonaut "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Denne varianten bruker sin egen konfigurasjon nedenfor, ikke produktets "
"Pixonaut-fane."

#. translators: %1$s: pictures drawn so far, %2$s: pictures to draw, of one product. Regenerate now's progress.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:23
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s pictures"
msgstr "%1$s av %2$s bilder"

#. translators: %1$s: products done so far, %2$s: products selected. Regenerate now's progress.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:25
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s products done"
msgstr "%1$s av %2$s produkter ferdige"

#. translators: Regenerate now's progress: the product's pictures are not drawn yet.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:27
msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "Venter"

#. translators: Regenerate now's progress: the product's pictures are drawn.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:29
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Ferdig"

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:30
msgid "Pixonaut could not draw some pictures; they are tried again later."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunne ikke lage noen av bildene; det blir forsøkt på nytt senere."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:31
msgid "Your own image is kept."
msgstr "Ditt eget bilde beholdes."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:32
msgid "Being drawn in the background."
msgstr "Lages i bakgrunnen."

#. translators: Regenerate now's progress: the request drawing this product's picture failed.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:34
msgid "Could not be drawn here. It stays queued for the background."
msgstr "Kunne ikke lages her. Det blir liggende i køen i bakgrunnen."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:35
msgid "The product images are regenerated. Close this to see them."
msgstr "Produktbildene er laget på nytt. Lukk dette vinduet for å se dem."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:36
msgid "Some product images could not be regenerated. See each product above."
msgstr "Noen produktbilder kunne ikke lages på nytt. Se hvert produkt ovenfor."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:37
msgid "Stopped. The products not drawn yet are drawn in the background."
msgstr "Stoppet. Produktene som ikke er laget ennå, lages i bakgrunnen."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:38
msgid "The product images could not be regenerated. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Produktbildene kunne ikke lages på nytt. Prøv igjen om litt."

#. translators: Heading of Regenerate now's dialog while the pictures are drawn.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:41
msgid "Regenerating product images"
msgstr "Lager produktbildene på nytt"

#. translators: Heading of the confirmation before Regenerate now draws the product images.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:52
msgid "Regenerate now?"
msgstr "Lag på nytt nå?"

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:54
msgid ""
"The product images are drawn right away, in this tab, one product after "
"another. The site is busier while it runs."
msgstr ""
"Produktbildene lages med en gang i denne fanen, ett produkt om gangen. "
"Nettstedet er mer belastet mens det pågår."

#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:55
msgid ""
"Keep this tab open until it finishes. Closing it or pressing Stop leaves the "
"rest to the background queue."
msgstr ""
"Hold denne fanen åpen til det er ferdig. Hvis du lukker den eller trykker på "
"Stopp, overlates resten til køen i bakgrunnen."

#. translators: Button in Regenerate now's confirmation: closes it without drawing anything.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:63
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Avbryt"

#. translators: Button stopping Regenerate now; the products not drawn yet are left to the background queue.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:65
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Stopp"

#. translators: Button closing Regenerate now's dialog once it finished or was stopped.
#: templates/admin/regenerate-now.php:66
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Lukk"

